title: SMBv1 Protocol Usage
id: 3d6f8deb-99ef-4526-b3dc-cc36c783220a
status: experimental
description: Detects use of the deprecated SMBv1 dialect on the network, which is vulnerable to exploits such as EternalBlue and should not appear in modern environments.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1210/
logsource:
  category: network_connection
detection:
  selection:
    protocol: 'smb'
    dialect: 'SMBv1'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - src_ip
  - dst_ip
  - dst_port
falsepositives:
  - Legacy devices that only speak SMBv1
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.lateral_movement
  - attack.t1210
